# Copy to .dev.vars (local Worker) and fill. Never commit .env or .dev.vars.
# Optional Google Gemini key: BACKUP AI only. The primary AI is open-weight Llama 3.1 8B on Workers AI (binding "AI",
# no key). Without either, the page shows the labelled offline rules summary.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Any long random string; signs the server evidence receipts. Make one with: openssl rand -hex 32
SEAL_SECRET=
